":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-03-11T03:59:55Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T16:10:51Z","closed_at":"2025-04-04T16:10:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n-Reproducible in 4.4-stable, 4.4-rc3, 4.4-rc2, 4.4-rc1, 4.4-dev1\n-Not reproducible in 4.3-stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Vulkan Forward+ - NVidia GeForce RTX 3050 Ti Laptop GPU\n\n### Issue description\n\nBatching breaks in the Forward+ renderer when a material has the Transparency set to Depth Pre-Pass. I tested both the `RenderingServer` API as well as the node approach (`MeshInstance3D`) and the result is the same.\n\nIn Godot 4.3-stable, we can see the expected result, 3 draw calls (shadows disabled for simplicity):\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4c6d062-47bd-4681-8dd5-cf46aab4bea7)\n\nIn Godot 4.4-dev1, we see the regression (showing 2433 draw calls):\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c13fb53b-5182-45f8-b596-67d6ca0f6470)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe core of the code is to instantiate a bunch of meshes with a few materials - we expect the batcher to be able to sort these properly and reduce draw calls in Forward+.\n\n```\n@onready var node_3d: Node3D = $Node3D\nconst BOX_MESH = preload(\"res://box_mesh.tres\")\nconst MATERIALS := {\n\t0: preload(\"res://red.tres\"),\n\t1: preload(\"res://blue.tres\"),\n\t2: preload(\"res://green.tres\")\n}\nfunc node_test() -> void:\n\tvar mat := 0\n\t\n\tfor x in range(100):\n\t\tfor z in range(100):\n\t\t\tvar m := MeshInstance3D.new()\n\t\t\tm.mesh = BOX_MESH\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tvar t := Transform3D()\n\t\t\tt.origin = Vector3(-100,0,-100) + Vector3(2 * x, 0, 2 * z)\n\t\t\tm.transform = t\n\t\t\tm.set_surface_override_material(0, MATERIALS[mat])\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tnode_3d.add_child(m)\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tmat += 1\n\t\t\tif mat >= 3: mat = 0\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[instancing-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19175306/instancing-test.zip)\n\nRun the MRP, check the Total Draw Calls from the Monitors tab.","closed_by":{"login":"skyace65","id":6080368,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODAzNjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6080368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65","html_url":"https://github.com/skyace65","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103954/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103954/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}